  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat (400°F/200°C).",
    "Thread pork cubes onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "In a bowl, whisk together chili flakes, brown sugar, garlic, soy sauce, and honey.",
    "Add the marinade to the pork, toss to coat, and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Grill skewers for 8-10 minutes, flipping halfway through, until they reach an internal temperature of 145°F (63°C).",
